Slide 1: Project Title
Livestock Production and Productivity Analysis System is
a database application project that focuses on managing and analysing 
livestock production and productivity information in Rwanda. The project will use
Oracle Database and PL/SQL to store, organize, validate, and process livestock production records. 
Oracle APEX will be used to develop a user-friendly interface where users can enter data, 
search for information, view reports, and understand livestock production trends
